my_df <- data.frame(rock = runif(100, 0, 20), paper = runif(100, 10, 25), scissors = runif(100, 0 , 25))

why will this work at the console in rstudio:
ggvis(my_df) %>% layer_histograms(prop("x", as.symbol("rock")))

whereas the following will not work within shiny server (I get 'invalid type/length (symbol/0) in vector allocation' and the app aborts):
