I would like to have a dynamic UI element that puts up more than one widget.
Is this possible?
I tried the most straightforward thing (in server.R):

    output$foo <- renderUI({
        sliderInput('a',"a description",min=0,max=200,value=c(50,150))
        sliderInput('b',"b description",min=0,max=200,value=c(50,150))
    })

and I see only one slider.  Turns out:  the 'b' one.

Thanks for any help!!!

