Found the solution!
Thanks to Herman Sontrop <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/xW8f5g5gm4s/_2TA5S_2HV4J>.

The key is putting the widgets into a list:

output$foo <- renderUI({
        LL = list()
        LL[[1]] = list(sliderInput('a',"a description",min=0,max=200,value=c(50,150)))
        LL[[2]] = list(sliderInput('b',"b description",min=0,max=200,value=c(50,150)))
        return(LL)
    })

