Yihui posted the necessary fix at http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30269537/reactive-serverside-shiny-datatable-with-extensions

My initial post didn't show that I was
incorrectly using searching = FALSE as an option within DT::renderDataTable(options(...))
incorrectly using rownames=FALSE as a parameter to DT::renderDataTable(), instead of  dataTableAjax and datatable

