Hi,

why do you not follow the gettext idea, e.g.

translation_df <- data.frame(English = c("Hello", "Goodbye"),
                             Spanish = c("Hola", "Adios"))

input <- list(language=1)

gettext <- function (txt) {
  pos <- which(translation_df$English==txt)
  translation_df[pos, input$language]
}

input <- list(language=1)
print(gettext("Hello"))
input <- list(language=2)
print(gettext("Hello"))

Best Sigbert

